# Patterns the helm toolchain excludes from packaged archives.
# NOTE: `charts/` and `*.tgz` must NOT be ignored here — Helm loads dependency
# archives through the same ignore rules, and ignoring the directory makes
# every `file://` dependency invisible to lint/template (verified, helm 4.3.1).
# Resolved dependency tarballs stay out of git via the root .gitignore.
.git
.gitignore
.svn
.project
.hg
.hgignore
.cvs
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
~
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
# Rendering/test artifacts
*.rendered.yaml
# The chart's render inputs (CHT-06): tests/values.test.yaml is read from the
# source tree by helm template -f (helm.ts and the chart suites), never from
# the archive — helm-publish (CHT-05) ships without it. The leading / keeps
# the match at the chart root, so a future templates/tests/ hook dir is safe.
/tests/
